# The mod overlay must reach `git apply` byte-for-byte: Git for Windows' default
# core.autocrlf=true would check it out with CRLF line endings, and a CRLF patch
# no longer matches Readest's LF sources ("patch does not apply").
# Unified diffs contain single-space context lines; do not flag those as source
# trailing whitespace when adding a supplementary patch.
*.patch -text -whitespace
